FOR (Target Customer): Students, employees, and anyone who uses the internet and receives suspicious links.

WHO (Problem): People need an easy way to check whether a link might be dangerous before clicking it. 

THE PLDetect IS A (Product): A website that checks suspicious links for possible phishing threats.

THAT (Main Benefit): Shows a risk score, explains why a link may be dangerous, and gives safety tips to users.

UNLIKE (Existing Alternatives): Other link-checking tools that may only show whether a link is safe or dangerous without explaining the reasons clearly.

OUR PRODUCT (What Makes It Different): PLDetect explains the warning signs in simple language and helps users understand how to stay safe online.
